<title>USA: Personnel Group buys BEST Consulting.</title>
<headline>Personnel Group buys BEST Consulting.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Personnel Group of America Inc said Wednesday that it bought BEST Consulting Inc. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>BEST, a Seattle-based information technology consulting firm, reported pro forma revenues for 1995 of $57 million.</p>
<p>Personnel Group of America is a personnel staffing company.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
